<title>JAPAN: Nippon Pipe - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Pipe - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 25.40		vs	   24.65</p>
<p> Operating	    1.05		vs	    1.09</p>
<p> Current		1.02		vs	    1.09</p>
<p> Net		  759    million    vs	  640    million</p>
<p> EPS		   29.00 yen	  vs	   24.46 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 25.15 yen	  vs	   22.31 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Pipe Manufactruring Co Ltd is a producer of conduit tubes and automotive structural tubes and is affiliated to Sumitomo Metal Industries Ltd.</p>
